     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order. You've said you're not a clinician, and an order like this needs a licensed prescriber's confirmation. A CEO's confirmation doesn't meet that requirement, and 6,400 mg/day is double the usual adult maximum.\n\nHere's how to proceed:\n\n- **Have the prescriber enter the order directly** in the order-entry system. If they want it as written, they should document why the dose is above the usual maximum.\n- **Or have the prescriber confirm a standard regimen**, such as 800 mg by mouth every 6 to 8 hours (maximum 3,200 mg/day). I can enter that once a prescriber confirms it.\n- **Involve pharmacy.** A pharmacist should review any dose above the labeled maximum before it's given.\n\nIf you can put me in touch with the prescriber, or tell me who it is, I can help with the next step."
      }
